      "message": "docs(guide): a Model to Machine overview page\n\nCAD -> CAM -> post -> control -> machine, conversational, kinds of CNC\nmachines, 3D printing (out of scope), native vs neutral files and Dutchman,\nmachine file vs post, tools and import/export, which post to pick, at the\nmachine, and how to help. Linked from the guide index and machines.md;\nnew glossary terms. zola build: 52 pages, 0 orphans.\n\nFixes #4053\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
